# GitBook

> GitBook is a collaborative platform for creating, publishing and managing
> **Product Documentation** and **API Documentation**, as well as technical docs,
> changelogs, help centers, localization, and guides for migrations and
> integrations. Powered by AI-driven search, analytics and interactive tooling.
> GitBook supports **Enterprise Product Documentation** programs with SSO and
> SAML, granular permissions, authenticated and private publishing, adaptive
> content and content governance. Published GitBook sites automatically expose a
> Markdown version of every page, an llms.txt index and an MCP server.

